POST  http://localhost:3000/customer HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "accountNumber": "1234567890",
  "city": "Delhi",
  "age": 30,
  "balance": 1000,
  "accountType": "savings"
}


###
GET http://localhost:3000/customers HTTP/1.1

###
GET http://localhost:3000/customer/1234567890 HTTP/1.1

### *filter on city
GET http://localhost:3000/customers/filter?city=Delhi&accountType=savings HTTP/1.1

### *find and update city of customer using account number
PATCH http://localhost:3000/customer/1234567890 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Mumbai"
}

### !delete customer using account number
DELETE http://localhost:3000/customer/1234567890 HTTP/1.1